  "faq": {
    "tag": "·FAQ·",
    "title": "The things people",
    "title_2": "ask us the most.",
    "q1": "How long before receiving an offer?",
    "a1": "Verified providers near you respond quickly. For Tech, Music and Transport categories, most requests receive at least 2 offers in under 15 minutes during the day.",
    "q2": "How does secured payment work?",
    "a2": "When you accept an offer, your card is charged but the money stays held by Stripe. The provider only receives payment after your validation. If something goes wrong, we refund.",
    "q3": "What happens if I need to cancel my request?",
    "a3": "As long as no offer has been accepted, you can cancel for free. Once an offer is accepted, conditions apply depending on the delay and category.",
    "q4": "Are providers verified?",
    "a4": "All providers go through KYC (identity + address) before being able to submit offers. Providers rated below 3.5/5 after 10 missions are automatically suspended.",
    "q5": "What is the platform commission?",
    "a5": "10% of the mission amount, automatically deducted from the provider's payment. No hidden fees on the client side: the price shown by the provider is the price you pay.",
    "q6": "Can I use a promo code?",
    "a6": "Promo codes are coming soon! Sign up on the waitlist to be notified first."
  },
